snippet.textDisplay:
@Peepsmarshmellows I get your skepticism about AI in creative fields, but consider this: Animation studios regularly face crushing deadlines where artists work 80+ hour weeks, sleeping at their desks, just to deliver on time.

AI can handle the tedious in-between frames or color grading that eats up precious hours, letting skilled artists focus on the unique movements and style that clients actually pay for.

It's not about replacing talent - it's about preventing burnout so artists like Harut can keep creating their best work without sacrificing their health.

