@jonathanhenry5465 you're missing the point. All of this is a grand scheme to bring slavery back. When people will be out of a job, they will be forced to bow and serve people in power not for money, but for their livelihood - for free.

Now with money in play, you can change your job anytime. In slavery, you will be forced to stay a slave to your master - which could be a rich person or a commanding robot.

You can read up on slavery in history. Removing slavery from the system was one of the hardest challenges of humankind, but we were mislead. We didn't remove it, we just postponed it.

